summary:
  The search stops reading "rock 80 uk" as a genre, a decade and a country.

history:
  Typed without the word "in", the wish went to the directory as a station
  name, found nothing, and the stem retry answered with French and German
  "rock 80" stations. The facet reading arrived on 2026-09-21; this takes
  its one call in the search away. The call lives in SearchLogic.reading
  since 2026-11-10, where a test reads its answer.

target:
  package/contents/ui/SearchLogic.js

find:
          var bare = facetQuery(t, ask);

replace:
          var bare = null;

expect:
  Killed by tst_searchlogic::test_a_country_beside_a_genre_or_after_in_is_no_guess.
  Line-neutral.
